あ、じゃあ、皆さん、はい、次の問題いこうで。
Ah, well, everyone, yes, let's move on to the next question.

592
00:37:14,208 --> 00:37:16,898
正解者がでたら、の脱ぎます。
If someone gets it right, I'll take off...

593
00:37:17,428 --> 00:37:18,018
脱ぎます。
I'll take it off.

594
00:37:18,538 --> 00:37:19,828
その、型、型。
That, form, form.

595
