ギンギンギラギラなギ酸　RISING 酸
Giningin-giragira formic acid, RISING Acid!

799
01:00:10,582 --> 01:00:13,382
少々イキった硝酸　すたこらさっさと退散
Slightly cocky nitric acid, scurrying off and dismissing!

800
01:00:13,582 --> 01:00:15,822
頼もしい輩
Such reliable fellows!

801
01:00:16,482 --> 01:00:20,442
どんな修羅場でもあたしにかかれば
No matter what critical situation, if it's up to me...

802
